%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 5a584a25f7a2f6c23a420ed9d0c79f73, type: 3}
  m_Name: npc_linn
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::AthenHill.NpcDefinition
  id: npc_linn
  displayName: Linn
  role: Hill regular
  nodes:
  - id: greeting
    title: Hill regular
    text: Looking for someone? Try the shade. Sooner or later everyone comes up here, even the people who swear they are too busy.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: cf75b54e0d214dd6ad778263acc75723, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: tree
      label: Why does everyone meet here?
      next: hill
      action: 
    - id: housing
      label: Is there anywhere in Ward I could stay?
      next: housing
      action:
      requires: primer, !flag:home_leased
      setFlag: home_asked
    - id: leave
      label: I will stay for a moment.
      next: 
      action: close
  - id: hill
    title: Hill regular
    text: You can see the gate, hear the market, and get out of the dust. No terminal needs to explain that. If we get separated, meet me on the hill.
    voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4a0d8d8ea8974efb9f56c5a66b1bf62e, type: 3}
    choices:
    - id: back
      label: Who comes up here?
      next: greeting
      action: 
    - id: leave
      label: On the hill. Got it.
      next: 
      action: close
  - id: housing
    title: The housing roll
    text: There is a rust-red container against the south wall, behind the Nanofab yard. The family who fitted it out went with a Karaveen caravan last season. Bunk, a steel locker, shelves, a window that shuts. Forty credits takes the lease off the roll and the key is yours. Keep the locker for your salvage; the Berms will fill your pack faster than you think.
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - id: lease
      label: I'll take the lease (40 credits).
      next: housing_leased
      action: lease_home
      requires:
      setFlag:
    - id: later
      label: Not yet. I'll come back.
      next:
      action: close
      requires:
      setFlag:
  - id: housing_leased
    title: The housing roll
    text: Then it is yours. The door knows you now. Rest on the bunk when the Berms wear you down, and come back up the hill when you need someone to talk to.
    voice: {fileID: 0}
    choices:
    - id: leave
      label: Thank you, Linn.
      next:
      action: close
      requires:
      setFlag:
